PokemonMansion_B4F_Text_YouReadThemAll::
    .string "…You found the stairs. Then you've\n"
    .string "read them all, every diary and\l"
    .string "every log.\p"
    .string "I am the last of the team. I\n"
    .string "stayed down here when the others\l"
    .string "fled.$"

PokemonMansion_B4F_Text_HowMewCame::
    .string "The diaries say MEW was discovered\n"
    .string "in Guyana. That's only half of it.\p"
    .string "We never caught MEW. It followed\n"
    .string "our boat home, playing in the\l"
    .string "wake.\p"
    .string "It trusted us. And we took its\n"
    .string "cells while it slept.$"

PokemonMansion_B4F_Text_DayMewtwoEscaped::
    .string "The diary stops on September 1. I\n"
    .string "kept writing.\p"
    .string "September 9. M-2, the one we named\n"
    .string "MEWTWO, broke its tank at dawn.\p"
    .string "It didn't attack me. It looked at\n"
    .string "me once, and then it was gone.\p"
    .string "The fire started after that. The\n"
    .string "mansion has been empty ever since.$"

PokemonMansion_B4F_Text_TakeTheseNotes::
    .string "Here. My last notes, and what's\n"
    .string "left of our research.\p"
    .string "Someone who read every page should\n"
    .string "have them.$"

PokemonMansion_B4F_Text_ResearcherAfter::
    .string "If you ever meet MEWTWO or MEW,\n"
    .string "treat them better than we did.$"

PokemonMansion_B4F_Text_BagIsFull::
    .string "Your BAG is full. Make some room\n"
    .string "and come back.$"

